{"server":"tw","storyId":"act15side_level_act15side_st01","groupId":"act15side","stageId":"act15side_st01","title":"客將至","storyCode":"IW-ST-1","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"5101c274f68cd40046f86864b9a623b4040d943443471ba5ada8dca365ff10f7","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"來自龍門的老鯉抵達了尚蜀，選了行裕客棧做落腳點。而另一面，克洛絲與烏有也翻山越嶺，來到尚蜀地界。不過，似乎有什麼陰謀在等待著他們。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"纯1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g01_yanstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"清晨時分，多雲天氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"narration","text":"大炎尚蜀，應峰路，有一家客棧。\n大炎如今，還叫客棧的店，多也不多。\n不過這裡古色古香，好酒好茶，有尚蜀最好的風情在。\n紅色的牌匾，金色的字。\n“行裕”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃模樣的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"湖松酒十壇，雲遼酒三壇，歸行老酒六壇......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃模樣的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劉二，你這兒的業績，怎麼比渡口那邊少了這麼多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這您不能怪我啊，渡口那兒月初不知怎麼的，熱熱鬧鬧地辦了好幾次宴，賣得比我們這好不是理所當然的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃模樣的人","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擺幾次席，能差多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲喂，您別站著說話不腰疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您那幾天不在尚蜀，是不知道那排場有多誇張......說那是開張吃半年，一點都不過分啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說了，前幾個月分明是我們業績更好，就這兩天翻了船。鄭大掌櫃，您可不能大小眼啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要知道我們這家門店，可是最早做起來，最早做大的。其他店鋪——要我說啊——見到我們都得喊一聲老漢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您可不能搞隔代親，有了孫子忘了兒啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哭喪什麼，誰是你老漢？我還什麼都沒說呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真等您說出口，那不就全完囉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是運氣不好，沒碰上那幾個貴人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那怎麼不見你運氣好一回？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉！貴人貴人，哪來這麼多貴人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一直都靠老主顧捧場，廣告也不肯打，哪怕請幾個漂亮姑娘帥小夥也好啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（瞪）......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我啥也沒說。剛才那是在放屁呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開酒樓客棧，憑的是貴人，靠的是關係，這話是不假。可你又怎麼知道誰是貴人，誰不是呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是什麼都懂，我也當掌櫃啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好好學著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有錢有勢有牌面的爺，是個明眼人都看得出來，哪輪得到你這不開竅的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走江湖也好，在城裡安家立業也好，只要人活著，少不了和別人打交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要打交道，就少不得一雙眼。識人，識事，我們才有今天的好日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整天不正經，打烊就去麻將館，你能有什麼出息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼不罵了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒見門前有兩位客人嗎！還不快去迎客！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎喲......我還真沒看見，快快，裡邊請！本日頭兩位客人，送鹽花生兩碟，菊花茶一壺！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們似乎運氣不錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......時間趕早，就當我先替梁大人，為您接風洗塵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位先坐，茶水一會兒就到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為我們會直奔著梁府去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老船夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那位“朋友”，好歹是一方父母官，忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鯉","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忙到怠慢朋友，看來是真忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"客棧夥計","speakerId":"avgnew_npc_140_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大掌櫃大掌櫃，那您瞧著，這兩個人算不算貴人？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鄭掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_300_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少問多看，人不可貌相。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g05_mountaincity_d"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......慢著，土木天師是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人有所不知，大炎設有不止一處天師府，天下學子但凡源石技藝小有所成，都可以報考加入，經過層層考校，為國效力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石技藝的應用方向有很多種，源石科學也是蓬勃發展，大炎天師自然也需要分門別類，此所謂術業有專攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為這種酷酷的稱呼，都是指驚蟄小姐那樣能征善戰的施術者來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"驚蟄小姐就是恩人之前提過的羅德島的那位炎國大官？哎呀，其實很久以前確是如此，只不過時代變化，民生大過天嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石技術造福民眾，而對源石技藝與源石工程研究投入畢生心血的，就是大炎工部與各處天師府了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把山挪到移動城市上啊......放在其他國家，這種事情肯定無法想像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是。不過雖說山水有情，但要真是勞民傷財，倒也不至於折騰這麼大陣仗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主要還是有些土木天師對家鄉心心念念，嘔心瀝血，非說什麼移山小事一樁，不能捨山莊村落於不顧，硬按著當地官員答應了下來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炎國有句老話，一方水土養一方人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜我在源石技藝方面實在是捉襟見肘，不然如果我是那些建造移動城市的人，我也會是同樣的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們大炎人都是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為眼前有如此江山——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_i09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"風光無限。早春聽雪，別有韻味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果恩人自小生活在這裡，興許也會有這種想法吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......確實說不定呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——真清爽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“尚蜀風高，撥雲弄月”，確實是名副其實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"尚蜀地界有“三山十七峰”的美景，來旅遊的人還挺多的，還會有一些外國貴族特地前來瞻仰呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，想必還是因為尋常百姓在這大地上跋山涉水太困難了，不然這些名勝古跡，怕是早就人滿為患了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好舒服的風。我本來還擔心今天下雨，耽擱我們走山路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恩人說的是。春風拂面，細雨紛來，潤物無聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"之前我就想問了，你不是個練武的嗎？哪來這麼多文縐縐的用詞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"習武可不耽擱學文化，師父常這麼教訓。習武是傳統，學文也是傳統，好好學習，是現代人的義務......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......再說，話術也是賺錢的門道嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，要不要順道遊覽一番最近的山頭？聽說這兩年，山裡的人也多起來了，熱鬧得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不了吧，我們進城休整一兩天，等到那姐妹倆與我們會合，就得繼續趕路了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不過我還是第一次有這種可惜了沿途風景的心情呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恩人向來專心致志，只向目標，心無二物，說明恩人工作認真，沒有絲毫懈怠呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......沒有絲毫懈怠......我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這種好話可以多說點喔，我不會當真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸，恩人，不過是帶我去辦事處入職罷了，這點小事，犯不著那麼急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也聽炎熔恩人說了，您這趟遠遊，本來也有放假散心的心思，那就更沒必要耽誤恩人遊山玩水，對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g06_mountainroad_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是小炎熔也在就好了......需要整理思緒的，也不止我一個人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔恩人只是突然受了委託，走另一條路而已，想必沿途風景，也是看得到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不覺得小炎熔會是那種停下腳步來欣賞風景的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，炎熔恩人一直如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"avg_1021_kroos2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其實以前，她不是現在這樣，當然我也不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......恩人不必介懷，事在變，人在變，世事無常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏有","speakerId":"avgnew_455_nothing_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還是早些趕路吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g01_yanstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杜小姐，人找到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錯不了，從爭山渡進城，已經到了未長區應峰路，安排了信得過的人，一路跟著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門人，隨身帶了個古董匣子，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，看得一清二楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出了岔子，你們可是要擔責的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街頭青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_303_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大小姐交代的事，出不了岔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜小姐","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就替那些膽小怕事的老傢伙們，去會一會這個江洋大盜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
